Error: Jet.ValueTypeMismatch: `Point` can't use `:Hex(n)`
  --> Tests/UI/E0112_style_selector_needs_trait_impl.jet:8:13
    |
  8 |     print("{point:Hex(4)}")
    |             ^^^^^
 Why: `:Hex(n)` calls `hex` of `HexFormat`, which Point doesn't implement
 Fix: Implement it, `impl Point.HexFormat { hex: fn(self, digits: Int) -> String { … } }`, or use bare interpolation for this value
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ValueTypeMismatch
